# Cloudflare Pages headers.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WHY: by default Pages served every asset with `Cache-Control: public,
# max-age=14400, must-revalidate` (4h browser cache). That left returning
# visitors running an OLD topics.js after a deploy — so a newly-live topic was
# missing from the mp3 player's next/prev track, the progress page and "my
# sentences" (all three read topics.js) until the 4h cache expired. The topic
# PAGES still loaded (fresh navigation), which made it look half-wired.
#
# FIX: the files that carry app logic or SSR content must always revalidate, so
# a deploy takes effect immediately for everyone. etag makes this cheap (304s,
# REVALIDATED at the edge). Fonts/images keep the default long cache (stable
# names, perf budget) — they're not listed here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Shared single-source scripts (change on most deploys)
/topics.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/player.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/nav.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/auth.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/footer.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# Homepage + all HTML pages, and topic pages by clean URL (SSR content)
/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/topic-*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
